OL,3,AIranian attack on Saudi tanker killed
OL,4,Atwo Filipino sailors, Saudi Arabia says
OL,5,
OL,6,FSaudi Arabia has condemned what it said
OL,7,Fwas an Iranian attack on a Saudi-owned
OL,8,Fsupertanker on Monday night that killed
OL,9,Ftwo Filipino sailors.
OL,11,FThe Saudi national shipping company,
OL,12,FBahri, confirmed on Wednesday that its
OL,13,Fvessel Sidr was "involved in a security
OL,14,Fincident while transiting the Strait of
OL,15,FHormuz".
OL,17,FSidr was hit by projectiles north of
OL,18,FOman's Musandam Peninsula, according to
OL,19,Fmaritime security firms. A South
OL,20,FKorean-owned supertanker, Senegal
OL,21,FProsperity, was reportedly struck east
OL,22,Fof Musandam around the same time.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
