OL,3,ARosenberg: Putin's veiled threat to UK
OL,4,Apart of Russia's campaign against West
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussian President Vladimir Putin
OL,7,Fresponded with one short sentence when
OL,8,Fasked at a press conference whether
OL,9,FMoscow might strike military facilities
OL,10,Fin the UK in response to British arms
OL,11,Fsupplies to Ukraine.
OL,13,F"That's a secret. A military secret."
OL,15,FMilitary secret is not a "yes". And not
OL,16,Fa "no". It leaves us hanging.
OL,18,FAnd that, I suspect, is the point.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
